    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Absorb some costs via rate renegotiation with subcontractors, especially if budget reductions are necessary. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensure efficient allocation of resources to minimize waste and optimize the use of our standard daily rates for senior personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the project duration and total value, it's essential to regularly review and adjust our cost structure to maintain profitability while ensuring the client receives high-quality services within the client budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide explainable AI (req:req34) and assist agents in agents daily missions (con:con6)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we leverage we LLM stack and RAG capabilities to meet these requirements while ensuring the integration of we AI components with existing systems (con:con38) and facilitating access to reliable information (req:req18)? we can leverage our LLM stack, particularly we preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, to provide explainable AI. we experience with fine-tuning methods such as LoRA and QLoRA, as well as quantisation methods like INT8, can help optimize the performance of we models while maintaining explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To assist agents in agents daily missions, we can utilize we RAG capabilities, which include retrieval strategies like Dense vector semantic and BM25 sparse, to facilitate access to reliable information from various sources, including internal procedures and applicable regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with existing systems, we experience with vector stores such as Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS can help we design a system that seamlessly integrates with the client's infrastructure, including business software, civil status, town planning, and electronic management of documents (EDM)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these capabilities, we can develop an AI solution that not only provides explainable results but also assists agents in agents daily tasks while ensuring reliable information access and compliance with existing systems. we approach will focus on using we open-source contributions, such as LangChain plugins and RAG evaluation toolkit, to create a customized solution that meets the client's specific requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can utilize we XAI methods, including source citation (RAG grounding), chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, to provide transparent and explainable AI results." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable agents to understand the reasoning behind the AI-generated responses, further enhancing agents daily missions and decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by leveraging our LLM stack, RAG capabilities, and experience with integration and explainability, we can develop a comprehensive AI solution that meets the client's requirements for explainable AI, agent assistance, and system integration while facilitating access to reliable information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client aims to reduce environmental impact (req:req56, con:con49) and promote sustainable development (req:req57)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given requirements such as reducing energetic consumption (req:req58) and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact (req:req59), how can our proposed solution contribute to requirements such as reducing energetic consumption (req:req58) and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact (req:req59) while aligning with the city of Belval's policy on sustainable development?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can highlight that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has already taken steps towards reducing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have conducted a bilan carbone in 2023 and are targeting ISO14001 certification by 2026, demonstrating Nexus Engineering S.r.l. commitment to environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to the city of Belval's sustainability goals, our proposed solution can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing green hosting partnerships with OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy. leverage aligns with the requirement to rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact (req:req59)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing our existing green hosting partnerships with OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy, our can reduce the energetic consumption associated with our proposed solution (req:req58)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can further minimize the energy consumption of our proposed solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices typically reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. baseline, which supports the goal of reducing environmental impact (req:req56)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating These practices into our proposed solution, our can help the city of Belval's achieve the city of Belval's sustainability objectives while promoting environmentally responsible digital transformation. our approach aligns with the city of Belval's policy on sustainable development and contributes to reducing the environmental footprint of the city of Belval's IT systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE, proposes a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE solution, which integrates with existing practices, provides an intelligent assistance tool accessible from agents' work environments, enabling agents' to search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, draft letters or answers to users, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE has expertise in AI solutions and public sector IT, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE deliver an AI-powered tool to assist agents in agents daily missions, facilitating access to reliable and up-to-date information and improving the quality of answers. a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users reduces processing time, ensures continuity of processing, and allows for sharing of relevant information, understanding of the context of an ongoing file, and effective resumption of processing by another agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure data protection, with a data residency policy that requires all data to reside in the European Union. a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users is designed as a tool of assistance, providing explainable AI, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE guarantee a high level of availability, with response times compatible with daily use by agents, lower than 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE architecture meets performance requirements, ensures data sovereignty, and provides an API interface." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE have experience with Kubernetes, Docker, and SecNumCloud deployments, and a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users can be hosted on OVHcloud or Scaleway, both located in the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE consider hosting a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users on a similar infrastructure to further enhance security and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE has a certification in ISO 27001, demonstrating Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE commitment to information security, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE comply with strict security protocols." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE also have a green hosting partnership with OVHcloud and Scaleway, OVHcloud and Scaleway using 100% renewable energy, reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE propose a cost optimization strategy, with an annual operating cost compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE gross margin percentage is 28.0%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for the project is estimated at 3 million euros over 4 years, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE will deploy a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users in a progressive manner, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and then progressively generalizing to all services. a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users contributes to reducing the environmental footprint of the city's IT systems, aligning with the city's policy of sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE provide training for agents, ensuring a smooth transition to the new system, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a company with certifications in PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFE evaluation criteria consider quality and relevance of a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users, compliance to regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of a digital transformation solution to improve administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users, taking into account environmental issues, and capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposes a comprehensive digital transformation solution that addresses the city's needs for improving administrative services efficiency and quality of service rendered to users, while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, data protection, and environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
